{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國科學技術院（KAIST）與美國佐治亞理工學院的研究團隊開發出一種聚丙烯腈（PAN）膜，可在室温下對真實原油進行預分離。研究發表於《自然》雜誌。與傳統蒸餾先將原油加熱至350攝氏度以上再冷凝分餾不同，這種方法不需要先加熱原油，目標是先濾出部分較輕組分，再交由現有蒸餾流程處理。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583492.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:54:59.168038+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:37:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T05:49:17.221125+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:49:17.221125+00:00","content_hash":"d11983efee409d160665641a00dbed60707ff03df54a353b733029fac036d698","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}